# 6. Assigning a ServiceAccount to a Pod

A Pod can explicitly specify its ServiceAccount using:

```yaml
serviceAccountName: my-app-sa
```

Example:

```yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: my-app
spec:
  serviceAccountName: my-app-sa

  containers:
    - name: app
      image: nginx
```

The relationship is:

```text
Pod
 |
 | serviceAccountName
 v
my-app-sa
```

Verify:

```bash
kubectl get pod my-app -o jsonpath='{.spec.serviceAccountName}'
```

