# 19. RBAC Request Flow

When an application attempts to access the Kubernetes API, the simplified flow is:

```text
                Application / Pod
                       |
                       v
                ServiceAccount
                       |
                       | Identity
                       v
                Kubernetes API
                       |
                       v
                 Authentication
                       |
                       v
                 Authorization
                       |
                       v
                      RBAC
                       |
                +------+------+
                |             |
              Allow          Deny
                |             |
                v             v
           API request      Forbidden
             succeeds        (403)
```

A useful mental model:

```text
WHO?
 |
 +-- ServiceAccount / User / Group
 |
WHAT?
 |
 +-- RBAC permissions
 |
WHERE?
 |
 +-- Resource + Namespace
 |
RESULT?
 |
 +-- Allowed / Denied
```

