# 25. Quick Revision

## ServiceAccount

```text
ServiceAccount
      |
      +-- Identity for workloads
      +-- Used by Pods
      +-- Can authenticate to Kubernetes API
      +-- Can be authorized using RBAC
```

## RBAC

```text
RBAC
 |
 +-- Role
 |     +-- Defines permissions in a namespace
 |
 +-- RoleBinding
 |     +-- Assigns Role permissions to a subject
 |
 +-- ClusterRole
 |     +-- Defines cluster-scoped/reusable permissions
 |
 +-- ClusterRoleBinding
       +-- Assigns ClusterRole permissions cluster-wide
```

## The most important relationship

```text
                 WHO?
                  |
                  v
           ServiceAccount
                  |
                  v
             RoleBinding
                  |
                  v
                Role
                  |
                  v
             Permissions
                  |
                  v
             Kubernetes
             Resources
```

### Remember these five lines

```text
ServiceAccount = Identity

Role = Permissions

RoleBinding = Assignment

ClusterRole = Cluster-scoped/reusable permissions

ClusterRoleBinding = Cluster-wide assignment
```

### Final mental model

```text
              "Who are you?"
                     |
                     v
              ServiceAccount
                     |
                     v
              "What can you do?"
                     |
                     v
                    RBAC
                     |
          +----------+----------+
          |                     |
        Role              ClusterRole
          |                     |
          v                     v
    Namespace scope        Cluster scope
          |                     |
          +----------+----------+
                     |
                     v
                Permissions
                     |
                     v
              Kubernetes API
```


